---
import DocLayout from '../../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---

<DocLayout title="Color" description="Farn color palette tokens and semantic layer">
  <h1>Color</h1>
  <p>
    Four palettes — Iron Night, Birch Mist, Forest, Bloom — organised by role.
    A two-layer token architecture separates raw palette values from semantic aliases,
    so components never need to know which theme mode they are in.
  </p>

  <h2>Palette Tokens</h2>
  <p>
    Raw palette tokens are defined once and never change. Use them directly only for
    brand moments and design showcases — all production components reference the
    semantic layer instead.
  </p>

  <h3>Iron Night — Dark Surfaces</h3>
  <div class="token-grid">
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#0D1117">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#0D1117">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--in0-void</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#0D1117 · lum 0.0055</div>
        <div class="token-role">Void</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Primary dark background. Ink-black with a slight blue-green undertone.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">primary dark background</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">primary text on light</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">tooltip</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">overlay / scrim</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#374151">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#374151">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--in1-iron</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#374151 · lum 0.0519</div>
        <div class="token-role">Iron</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Elevated dark surfaces — panels, cards, modals, floating popups. Border and state animations on light surfaces.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">elevated surface</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">panels</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">modals</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">icon background</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">border</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">state animations</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#4B5563">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#4B5563">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--in2-slate</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#4B5563 · lum 0.0784</div>
        <div class="token-role">Slate</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Selection, input fills, and active states on dark surfaces. Secondary text on light surfaces.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">selection</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">border</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">input fill</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">active states</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">secondary text</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#6B7280">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#6B7280">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--in3-ash</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#6B7280 · lum 0.1329</div>
        <div class="token-role">Ash</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Tertiary text on light surfaces. Captions, placeholders, and disabled states. AA-large only — 18px+ or 14px bold.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">tertiary text</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">captions</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">placeholders</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">disabled</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Birch Mist — Light Surfaces</h3>
  <div class="token-grid">
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#E4E2DA;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#E4E2DA" style="color:#374151;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.1)">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bm0-sand</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#E4E2DA · lum 0.7340</div>
        <div class="token-role">Sand</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Input fills, hover and active states on light surfaces. Tertiary text on dark surfaces.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">tertiary text</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">input fill</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">hover</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">active states</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">selection</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#EEEDE9;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#EEEDE9" style="color:#374151;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.1)">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bm1-linen</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#EEEDE9 · lum 0.8468</div>
        <div class="token-role">Linen</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Elevated surfaces, cards, and panels on light. Secondary text, hover, and state animations on dark.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">secondary text</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">hover</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">elevated surface</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">panels</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">modals</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">icon background</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#F5F4F0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#F5F4F0" style="color:#374151;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.1)">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bm2-parchment</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#F5F4F0 · lum 0.9041</div>
        <div class="token-role">Parchment</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Primary light background. Primary text on dark surfaces. CTA/button text in both modes. 13.07:1 on Void.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-dark">primary text on dark</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-light">primary light background</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">button / CTA text</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Forest — Accent</h3>
  <div class="token-grid">
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#5C9E86">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#5C9E86">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
