        <div class="token-role">Sage</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Supporting accent and dark-mode hover state for Fern. 5.19:1 on Void.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">supporting accent</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">accent hover</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#3E7A62">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#3E7A62">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--fo1-fern</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#3E7A62 · lum 0.1302</div>
        <div class="token-role">Fern — Primary Accent</div>
        <div class="token-desc">The primary accent in both modes — every button, link, focus ring, and CTA. WCAG AA on Parchment (4.80:1) and Void (4.68:1).</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">primary accent</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">primary CTA</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">links</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">focus ring</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#2D5E4A">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#2D5E4A">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--fo2-forest</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#2D5E4A · lum 0.0673</div>
        <div class="token-role">Forest</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Secondary accent depth. Accent hover in light mode. Badge text. 5.38:1 on Parchment.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">secondary accent</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">accent depth</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">badge text</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#254D5A">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#254D5A">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--fo3-deepwater</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#254D5A · lum 0.0527</div>
        <div class="token-role">Deepwater</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Code block backgrounds on light pages. Blockquote border accent.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">code block background</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">blockquote accent</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Bloom — Semantic States</h3>
  <div class="token-grid">
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#C5414C">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#C5414C">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bl0-ember</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#C5414C · on Parchment 4.51:1</div>
        <div class="token-role">Ember — Error</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Error states, destructive actions, form validation failures. The only red in the system.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">error</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">destructive</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">form validation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#AB5A2B">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#AB5A2B">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bl1-ochre</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#AB5A2B · on Parchment 4.51:1</div>
        <div class="token-role">Ochre — Annotation</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Annotations, decorators, and informational callouts.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">annotation</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">decorators</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">callouts</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#8D6B20">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#8D6B20">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bl2-grain</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#8D6B20 · on Parchment 4.48:1</div>
        <div class="token-role">Grain — Warning</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Warning states, draft status, pending review.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">warning</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">draft</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">pending</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#567A37">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#567A37">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bl3-moss</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#567A37 · on Parchment 4.51:1</div>
        <div class="token-role">Moss — Success</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Success states, published status, confirmations.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">success</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">published</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">active</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="token-card">
      <div class="token-color-strip" style="background:#885DB4">
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="#885DB4">copy</button>
      </div>
      <div class="token-info">
        <div class="token-name">--bl4-heather</div>
        <div class="token-hex">#885DB4 · on Parchment 4.47:1</div>
        <div class="token-role">Heather — Special</div>
        <div class="token-desc">Uncommon or special states — beta features, research content. The only purple in the system.</div>
        <div class="token-usage">
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">beta</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">research</span>
          <span class="usage-pill usage-both">uncommon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Semantic Token Layer</h2>
  <p>Components always reference semantic tokens — never palette tokens directly. The semantic layer resolves to the correct palette value per theme mode automatically.</p>

  <h3>Light Mode (default)</h3>
  <pre><code>:root,
[data-theme="light"] &#123;
  --color-bg:             var(--bm2-parchment);      /* Page background        */
  --color-bg-elevated:    var(--bm1-linen);           /* Cards, panels          */
  --color-bg-sunken:      var(--bm0-sand);            /* Input fills            */
  --color-bg-code:        var(--fo3-deepwater);       /* Code block background  */
  --color-text:           var(--in0-void);            /* Primary text           */
  --color-text-secondary: var(--in2-slate);           /* Supporting text        */
  --color-text-tertiary:  var(--in3-ash);             /* Placeholders, captions */
  --color-border:         var(--in3-ash);             /* Default border         */
  --color-border-strong:  var(--in1-iron);            /* Prominent dividers     */
  --color-border-subtle:  rgba(55,65,81,0.12);        /* Hairline borders       */
  --color-ghost-border:   rgba(55,65,81,0.25);        /* Ghost button border    */
  --color-accent:         var(--fo1-fern);            /* Primary CTA, links     */
  --color-accent-hover:   var(--fo2-forest);          /* Accent hover           */
  --color-accent-text:    var(--bm2-parchment);       /* Text on accent bg      */
  --color-error:          var(--bl0-ember);           /* Error, destructive     */
  --color-warning:        var(--bl2-grain);           /* Warning, draft         */
  --color-success:        var(--bl3-moss);            /* Success, published     */
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h3>Dark Mode</h3>
  <pre><code>[data-theme="dark"] &#123;
  --color-bg:             var(--in0-void);
  --color-bg-elevated:    var(--in1-iron);
  --color-bg-sunken:      var(--in0-void);
  --color-bg-code:        var(--in1-iron);
  --color-text:           var(--bm2-parchment);
  --color-text-secondary: var(--bm1-linen);
  --color-text-tertiary:  var(--bm0-sand);
  --color-border:         var(--in2-slate);
  --color-border-strong:  var(--bm0-sand);
  --color-border-subtle:  rgba(75,85,99,0.25);
  --color-ghost-border:   rgba(245,244,240,0.25);
  --color-accent:         var(--fo1-fern);
  --color-accent-hover:   var(--fo0-sage);
  --color-accent-text:    var(--bm2-parchment);
  --color-error:          var(--bl0-ember);
  --color-warning:        var(--bl2-grain);
  --color-success:        var(--bl3-moss);
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h3>Surface Overrides</h3>
  <p>Apply <code>data-surface</code> to any element to force a surface context regardless of the page-level theme. All child components inherit the re-scoped tokens automatically.</p>
  <pre><code>&lt;section data-surface="dark"&gt; &hellip; &lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-surface="light"&gt; &hellip; &lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-surface="tinted"&gt; &hellip; &lt;/section&gt;</code></pre>

  <h2>Accessibility</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Pair</th><th>Ratio</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Parchment on Void</td><td>13.07:1</td><td>&#10003; AA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Sand on Void</td><td>10.96:1</td><td>&#10003; AA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Fern on Parchment</td><td>4.80:1</td><td>&#10003; AA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Fern on Void</td><td>4.68:1</td><td>&#10003; AA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Sage on Void</td><td>5.19:1</td><td>&#10003; AA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Ember on Parchment</td><td>4.51:1</td><td>&#10003; AA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Parchment on Fern (button text)</td><td>4.80:1</td><td>&#10003; AA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Ash on Void</td><td>3.35:1</td><td>AA large only</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p><code>--in3-ash</code> is AA-large only — use at 18px or bold weight only, never for small body text. All Bloom tokens meet WCAG AA (4.5:1) against <code>--bm2-parchment</code> in light mode.</p>

  <h2>Usage Rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Never</strong> use Bloom colours as decorative accents — reserve them for semantic states only (error, warning, success, annotation).</li>
    <li>Iron Night tones must not appear as foreground text on light backgrounds — contrast is too low.</li>
    <li>Primary CTA: <code>--fo1-fern</code> background with <code>--bm2-parchment</code> text (4.80:1 &#10003;).</li>
    <li>Dark mode accent shifts Fern &rarr; Sage automatically. Both are the same palette family — the shift is imperceptible as a brand change but improves legibility.</li>
    <li>Components reference semantic tokens only. Palette tokens are for brand moments and one-off elements.</li>
  </ul>
</DocLayout>

<script is:inline>
  document.querySelectorAll('.copy-btn[data-copy]').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(btn.dataset.copy).then(() => {
        btn.textContent = 'copied!';
        btn.classList.add('copied');
        setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = 'copy'; btn.classList.remove('copied'); }, 1500);
      });
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  /* ── Token grid ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .token-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 var(--space-xl);
  }
  .token-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: box-shadow 150ms ease;
  }
  .token-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .token-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }

  /* ── Color strip ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .token-color-strip {
    height: 56px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .copy-btn {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; right: 8px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    color: var(--bm2-parchment);
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 4px 8px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    cursor: pointer;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 120ms ease, background 120ms ease;
  }
  .token-card:hover .copy-btn { opacity: 1; }
  .copy-btn:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.45); }
  .copy-btn.copied { background: rgba(62,122,98,0.8); }

  /* ── Token info ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .token-info { padding: 14px 16px; }
  .token-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .token-hex {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .token-role {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .token-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .token-usage {
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* ── Usage pills ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .usage-pill {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .usage-light { background: var(--bm0-sand); color: var(--in1-iron); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .usage-light { background: rgba(228,226,218,0.12); color: var(--bm0-sand); }
  .usage-dark  { background: var(--in1-iron); color: var(--bm0-sand); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .usage-dark { background: rgba(55,65,81,0.5); color: var(--in3-ash); }
  .usage-both  { background: rgba(62,122,98,0.1); color: var(--fo2-forest); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .usage-both { background: rgba(92,158,134,0.12); color: var(--fo0-sage); }
</style>
